'''Daboo of the Dead''' (亡者デブウ ''Mōja Debuu'', '''Dead Debuu''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Dead on Debut]]. He was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

