==Trivia==
*The name Daboo is derived from the Japanese word デブ ''debu'', meaning "fat" or "chubby". This is more obvious with his Japanese name, that being デブウ ''Debuu''. His English name is likely also derived from ''taboo''.
**His Japanese name might also be a reference to [[wikia:dragonball:Majin Buu|Majin Buu]] from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Ball|Dragon Ball]]'', as both are similarly fat with no neck.
*Among the first seven [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], Daboo of the Dead appears to represent the sin of gluttony.
*His gender is confirmed by the [[Media:DeadonDebutPoster.jpg|event poster]] for [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Dead on Debut]], which says, "No seals, no curses, no spells can hold him back!".
**Ironically, he's not Immune to Curse due to him predating said ability.
*He bears more than a passing resemblance to [[wikia:the-nightmare-before-christmas:Oogie Boogie|Oogie Boogie]], the main antagonist of the Tim Burton movie ''The Nightmare Before Christmas'', sharing the shape of his teeth, the bent over spike on his head and the stitches on each side of his body.
**This can be further supported by the fact that Daboo of the Dead's Italian name is "Babau of the Death", with Oogie Boogie's being "Bau Bau".
*His minimum money drop being 4,444 is likely a reference to how, in Japanese, one of the two pronunciations for the number 4 sounds exactly like the Japanese word for death. Moreover, he has four different immunities, he was the fourth [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]] added to the game, and his English name has four words while his Japanese name has four syllables (亡者デブウ, Mō-ja De-buu).
*Prior to the [[Version 5.10 Update]], he had Long Distance with an effective range of 0~800.
*He is the first non-collab enemy to have Omni Strike and the first non-stationary enemy besides [[Walpurgisnacht (Enemy)|Walpurgisnacht]] to have any immunities.
*He is tied with [[Johnnyleon]] for the highest health of all Zombies.
*Most of his stats are multiples of 3, sporting 3 million health, 30,000 attack damage, 300 range, 3 knockbacks, slowing cats for 300f and reviving with 300,000 health after 600f.
*He shares all of his immunities with his debut stage's reward, [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Curling Cat]] (minus Immune to Warp, which wasn't given to Curling Cat until [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]], and Immune to Wave, which Daboo does not possess).

